# All other fields retained from the existing repo CITATION.cff.
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Measuring the Wealth of Nations: Replication Package"
message: "If you use this software, please cite both this replication package and the original Shaikh & Tonak (1994) work."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Anderson
    given-names: Nicholas
    email: nickawebbox@gmail.com
    affiliation: "The New School for Social Research"
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"  # Nick to fill
repository-code: "https://github.com/andenick/measuring-the-wealth-of-nations"
abstract: >-
  Complete replication and extension of every empirical claim in Shaikh & Tonak's
  Measuring the Wealth of Nations (1994), plus 8 follow-up studies (Tonak 1984,
  Shaikh & Tonak 1987 and 2002, Moos 2017, Mohun 2005 and 2013, Karabacak & Tonak
  2022 Turkey, Cronin 2001 New Zealand), with 64 data series spanning 1947-2025.
  Built on the Anu Framework v12.2 with strict no-fabrication and full-provenance
  discipline; every value traces to a published source, cached API response, or
  documented derivation. Validated against book benchmarks and
  identity/cross-source consistency checks (95 passed / 2 skipped / 2 justified
  xfail; anu-doctor 0 errors / 0 warnings). v2.1 adds book-faithful gross-capital
  profit-rate variants (S513/S514/S517-GROSS-A; the printed book r* reproduced at
  mean error 0.0025) and a reconstructed time-varying I-O-uplift rate-of-exploitation
  arm (S506-EXT-MARX-KIO) with uncertainty-band sidecars, honest lambda precision,
  restored per-series author quotes, and Tier-A truth fixes; building on v2.0's
  comprehensive series-by-series review and D-batch book-fidelity decisions. The
  Chapter-7 labor-value series are first-class (proxy retired) and the AS/ES
  series adopt the canonical XS prefix. Every intentional deviation is recorded
  in DIVERGENCE_REGISTER (73 entries).
keywords:
  - marxian-economics
  - replication
  - shaikh-tonak
  - net-social-wage
  - rate-of-exploitation
  - input-output
  - heterodox-economics
license: MIT
version: "2.1.1"
date-released: "2026-07-10"
references:
  - type: book
    authors:
      - family-names: Shaikh
        given-names: Anwar
      - family-names: Tonak
        given-names: E. Ahmet
    title: "Measuring the Wealth of Nations: The Political Economy of National Accounts"
    publisher: Cambridge University Press
    year: 1994
    isbn: "9780521564793"
